WEBVTT

00:13:58.042 --> 00:14:00.184
So my hope is we're
going to do that tonight.

00:14:00.208 --> 00:14:03.601
EP: And what I get when I talk with you
is you force me to go for rigor

00:14:03.625 --> 00:14:06.851
because I am case-based,
rather than evidence-based.

00:14:06.875 --> 00:14:08.143
My research is different.

00:14:08.167 --> 00:14:10.434
I can go and look
at the psychological research

00:14:10.458 --> 00:14:11.726
on a lot of things,

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:13.976
but that's not the reality
in which I exist.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:19.476
So when you say "the research says,"
then I think I should go do some research.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:20.893
AG: And did you?
EP: Yes.

00:14:20.917 --> 00:14:25.976
I went yesterday, and I read
a chunk of research on trust.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:28.434
AG: And I listened
to one of your therapy sessions.

00:14:28.458 --> 00:14:32.476
So we've each become
a little bit more like the other.